_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/f9a45243895082a47b0d72749bfad79a.mp4?t=1781012418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👗 <strong>Customizable Avatars </strong>– Express yourself with your avatar, use emotes, dances or pre-defined lines to interact with (or distract) the enemy!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/613235a7e111b072e32b843b4194f74e.poster.avif?t=1781012418\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/613235a7e111b072e32b843b4194f74e.webm?t=1781012418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/613235a7e111b072e32b843b4194f74e.mp4?t=1781012418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Ranking System </strong>– Rise through the ranks, dominate the leaderboard, and enjoy the thrill of competitive play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7cf53a40549e9202ceb0e12e55576a7f.poster.avif?t=1781012418\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7cf53a40549e9202ceb0e12e55576a7f.webm?t=1781012418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837500/extras/7cf53a40549e9202ceb0e12e55576a7f.mp4?t=1781012418\" ty